OL,3,GNEWSARain 'takes away fire concerns'
OL,4,Afor steam rally
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn organiser of a Shropshire festival
OL,7,Fthat will exhibit hundreds of steam
OL,8,Fvehicles says recent rain has "taken
OL,9,Faway all our concern about fire risk".
OL,11,FShrewsbury Steam Rally is in its 65th
OL,12,Fyear and takes place on Sunday and bank
OL,13,Fholiday Monday at Onslow Park, in
OL,14,FBicton Heath.
OL,16,FEarlier in the month, the festival,
OL,17,Fwhich is expecting about 16,000
OL,18,Fvisitors over the two days, announced a
OL,19,Fcomplete ban on barbecues and fires due
OL,20,Fto the high risk of fires following
OL,21,Fweeks of hot, dry weather.
OL,23,APub: 28-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,358,350,200,160,0,100
